# baseline-t01-t10 vs v1-t01-t10

2 tasks in both runs. Metric: task_complete.

| | baseline-t01-t10 | v1-t01-t10 | change |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| tasks complete | 2.0/2 (100%) | 2.0/2 (100%) | +0.0 |
| latency per task (s) | 25.1 | 29.4 | +17% |
| model calls per task | 6.8 | 7.4 | +9% |
| input tokens per task | 7,549 | 9,074 | +20% |
| output tokens per task | 1,240 | 1,495 | +21% |

## Paths that changed

Reps of a task in which an agent was called. A task can keep its score and still take a different route.

| task | agent | baseline-t01-t10 | v1-t01-t10 |
| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |
| t10 | orders | 1/4 | 3/4 |

