## Verdict

**v1-t01-t10 holds.** It completes at least as many tasks as baseline-t01-t10 and no task got worse.

Notes:

- The route changed on t10. Where the change was not meant to touch a task, read its trace even if the score held, and say what the new route costs.
- Model for both runs: claude-opus-5.
